1
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:35,520
What are you doing?

2
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,600
My lord, this is the Yangchun wine sent by Duan Yurou

3
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,880
My lord, do you find it sweet?

4
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:20,880
Sweet

5
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:27,440
Dear Chen, what brings you here?

6
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:29,800
It's because you've failed to extract the whereabouts of the Dragon Jade

7
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:30,800
I've come to interrogate personally

8
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:32,560
Perfect timing

9
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,680
Bring me the Truth Serum Gu you gave me

10
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,120
Dear Chen

11
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,360
Don't be impatient

12
00:01:47,720 --> 00:01:50,040
The Truth Serum Gu refused to eat these past two days

13
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,360
It hasn't consumed enough blood yet

14
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:52,760
It can't be used now

15
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:53,720
Just as well

16
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,440
I had a physician examine Li Zhi'an's pulse

17
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:59,320
The physician said since Li Zhi'an was previously poisoned

18
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:00,520
Her constitution is weak

19
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,520
If we use the Truth Serum Gu

20
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:05,120
And fail to learn the whereabouts of the Li family's Dragon Jade treasure

21
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,880
It would be unfortunate if she died from the poison

22
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,720
So I wanted to ask you, Chen Lang

23
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:11,840
Is there an antidote for this Truth-Telling Gu?

24
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:13,800
This Truth-Telling Gu is indeed powerful

25
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:14,880
Wait

26
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,960
Could he be working with Duan Yurou

27
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:17,680
to test me?

28
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:19,040
If she dies, so be it

29
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,760
Why do you care about her?

30
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:22,960
Zhu Huaichen is coming

31
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:25,120
That won't do

32
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,080
The Li family's Dragon Jade treasure

33
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:29,080
is a crucial step for your ascension to the throne

34
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,680
We must ensure absolute success

35
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:34,240
It's also the only thing Yurou can do for you

36
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:38,080
Chen Lang, Yurou always wants to do something for you

37
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:40,720
You don't think I'm being nosy, do you?

38
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,160
You mean well

39
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,120
How could I ever resent you?

40
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,680
Of course

41
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:51,640
After all, Yurou belongs to Chen Lang

42
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,280
I've heard the Western Border people say

43
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:58,960
To lift the curse and save the victim

44
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:02,160
You need a bowl of heart's blood from the one who nurtured the venom

45
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,800
For the curse caster to drink

46
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:07,520
Then the venom will naturally emerge

47
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:15,640
Duan Yurou actually managed to send him away

48
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,840
She's clearly worried about Zhu Huaijin

49
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:23,520
Zhu Huaijin

50
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:26,800
Are you and Zhu Huaichen conspiring together?

51
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:30,680
Zhu Huaichen and I are sworn enemies

52
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:33,920
I vow to kill him in this lifetime

53
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,040
Not only will I kill him

54
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:40,480
I'll take everything he possesses

55
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:41,960
Zhu Huaijin

56
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:45,040
Why are you rebelling against Zhu Huaichen?

57
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:48,920
For you

58
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,240
For me?

59
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:56,560
Back then when you bested him before the Emperor

60
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,520
He held a deep grudge

61
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:01,000
His revenge wasn't just against you

62
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,880
But also for your Li family's Dragon Jade treasure

63
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:09,280
That's why he married you after blinding you with poison

64
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,960
Such a vicious and narrow-minded man

65
00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:16,960
I actually loved him my whole life

66
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,640
Zhu Huaichen

67
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:20,560
You deserve to die

68
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,440
Where is the letter from the Western Envoy?

69
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,440
Father Emperor burned it

70
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:31,920
Burned it

71
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:40,160
The Emperor of Nanliang actually burned the evidence of his own son's collusion with the enemy

72
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,160
So casually like this

73
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,560
Father wants us to fight among ourselves

74
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:46,240
To temper each other

75
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,720
In the struggle for imperial power

76
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,280
Without driving either side

77
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:52,120
To the point of complete exhaustion

78
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:54,280
He won't help us

79
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:58,240
No wonder you brothers are each more ruthless than the last

80
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,120
With a father like this

81
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:02,640
He treats all living beings under heaven as

82
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:03,720
Chips in your game

83
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,400
If not for him

84
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:09,120
Perhaps none of this would have happened

85
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:14,800
Then you staying by my side using his identity

86
00:05:16,320 --> 00:05:17,920
Was it also for the Dragon Jade?

87
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,800
This is what I owe you

88
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,920
What do you owe me?

89
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,960
I owe you

90
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:27,760
Get away

91
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,000
Would my lord care for another drink?

92
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,000
Who's there?

93
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,400
Don't panic, Princess Consort

94
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,160
I'm the prince's personal guard

95
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,160
The prince is drunk

96
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,280
I'll help him rest
